    "description": "— Blake Cashman led an onslaught of pressure all afternoon. Harrison Smith had the game-sealing interception.",
    "gameId": "401873014",
    "headline": "Vikings defense clamps down on Daniel Jones and the Colts for a 16-10 victory to stay undefeated",
    "id": 50279977,
